00:15.930 --> 00:17.010
Bachira-kun.

00:18.010 --> 00:23.940
I was going to ask if you could pass to me a couple of times, if possible.

00:24.020 --> 00:26.900
I've been crowding you too much. I'm sorry.

00:26.980 --> 00:29.400
Pass the ball 'to me'.

00:29.480 --> 00:30.530
<i>Glam...</i>

00:30.610 --> 00:33.740
We'll win with my 'glamorous' goals.

00:33.820 --> 00:35.160
Okay.

00:35.240 --> 00:38.120
Don't hold us up, let's push forward.

00:38.700 --> 00:39.830
We'll finish this quickly.

00:40.790 --> 00:41.660
Alright, alright.

00:48.460 --> 00:50.090
<i>Let's play, then,</i>

00:51.710 --> 00:53.800
<i>a truly fun match!</i>

02:30.020 --> 02:32.400
4TH STAGE
BATTLEFIELD

02:35.190 --> 02:37.570
SECOND SELECTION
4-ON-4 RIVALRY BATTLE

02:38.860 --> 02:40.200
Aryu-kun?

02:41.530 --> 02:43.870
What kind of care products do you use?

02:45.490 --> 02:48.870
The same ones everyone in the communal bath uses.

02:48.960 --> 02:51.670
Even so, your cuticles are very glam.

02:51.750 --> 02:54.960
You must be glam from birth.

02:56.460 --> 02:58.260
Don't touch my hair.

02:58.340 --> 03:01.010
Sorry. I couldn't help myself because of your beauty.

03:01.090 --> 03:03.300
I submit to glamour.

03:04.260 --> 03:07.060
It's an honor for me to clash with someone as glamorous as you.

03:07.140 --> 03:09.440
Nice to meet you, Chigiri Hyoma.

03:10.230 --> 03:11.600
<i>A beanpole.</i>

03:11.690 --> 03:14.110
<i>So I'll be matched up with him.</i>

03:16.690 --> 03:19.780
Your name is more normal than I thought, compared to your appearance.

03:19.860 --> 03:22.190
Nice to meet you too, Aryu Jyubei-san.

03:23.280 --> 03:28.410
Stop right there! That first name is not glamorous at all!

03:29.080 --> 03:32.880
It radiates the outdated vibe of samurai from the Sengoku period.

03:33.460 --> 03:36.460
That's my one and only obsession.

03:36.550 --> 03:39.720
I'll dispel all that atmosphere with my glamorous poses!

03:39.800 --> 03:41.220
Wait, Aryu-kun!

03:41.300 --> 03:44.190
If you move like that, you'll exhaust all your energy!

03:44.190 --> 03:47.930
Isagi, are these guys really strong?

03:48.020 --> 03:50.770
Yeah. They're good at soccer.

03:50.850 --> 03:52.140
Shut the hell up!

03:52.730 --> 03:56.230
Get into formation so we can finish this.

03:56.320 --> 03:58.440
I'm sorry!

03:58.530 --> 04:02.110
Should we give up on playing today?

04:03.070 --> 04:05.030
Look at the state Aryu-kun is in.

04:05.120 --> 04:06.740
Until both sides rest up—

04:06.830 --> 04:07.950
Denied.

04:08.040 --> 04:09.750
Get in position or I'll kill you.

04:10.750 --> 04:13.790
No way! We're finished. We're going to lose.

04:13.870 --> 04:16.710
So these authoritarian types really walk around in society.

04:16.790 --> 04:21.340
Confident people win and enjoy life regardless, don't they?

04:21.420 --> 04:23.220
Without knowing our suffering, too.

04:23.300 --> 04:26.600
They keep winning without a care in the world.

04:27.300 --> 04:29.640
Isagi, we're changing the formation.

04:30.390 --> 04:34.140
I'll take this pessimistic asshole.

04:35.150 --> 04:37.360
Who said I have no worries, damn it?

04:38.230 --> 04:42.110
Terrifying!

04:44.780 --> 04:45.910
<i>He doesn't budge a millimeter.</i>

04:46.620 --> 04:48.870
<i>He's like a muscular ox.</i>

04:50.450 --> 04:55.460
In that case, can you switch with Barou? Nagi?

04:58.790 --> 04:59.750
Sorry, Isagi.

05:00.340 --> 05:01.970
Can I be selfish too?

05:03.590 --> 05:05.880
<i>Unless I choose the path that excites me,</i>

05:05.970 --> 05:07.890
<i>there's no point in having separated from Reo.</i>

05:09.970 --> 05:12.310
I'm going to clash with number one.

05:15.230 --> 05:16.850
I want to become even stronger.

05:21.980 --> 05:25.650
But if we lose, I'll crush you in return.

05:26.240 --> 05:29.160
<i>I'm the one who will devour the whole field.</i>

05:29.950 --> 05:31.450
In that case,

05:32.910 --> 05:34.200
are you in, Bachira?

05:43.590 --> 05:45.090
<i>Give it everything.</i>

05:46.300 --> 05:48.090
<i>Get rid of everything.</i>

05:49.510 --> 05:50.850
<i>- The one who will win
- The one who will win</i>

05:52.010 --> 05:53.180
<i>- is me!
- is me!</i>

05:55.140 --> 05:57.390
<i>I'm coming for you, Isagi.</i>

05:57.480 --> 05:58.600
<i>As a start...</i>

05:59.400 --> 06:01.320
<i>A scissors dribble at full speed?</i>

06:01.940 --> 06:03.030
<i>Try and take it.</i>

06:03.110 --> 06:05.280
<i>After a fake step backwards,</i>

06:05.990 --> 06:06.990
<i>quickly the opposite way!</i>

06:07.070 --> 06:10.990
<i>I see. If it was the old him, I would've dodged him with that.</i>

06:11.080 --> 06:12.910
<i>How did he do that? Did he read my move?</i>

06:13.830 --> 06:16.910
<i>He's positioning himself by taking the whole field into account.</i>

06:17.410 --> 06:20.130
<i>Rather than going one-on-one,</i>

06:20.210 --> 06:23.130
<i>he's closing off the directions he doesn't want me to go.</i>

06:23.630 --> 06:25.550
<i>Since Nagi is on that side,</i>

06:25.630 --> 06:28.300
<i>they can handle it somehow if things go wrong, but</i>

06:28.380 --> 06:32.300
<i>there's no one on this side. A straight path to the goal.</i>

06:32.390 --> 06:36.770
<i>He matched up with me knowing that's the weakest spot in the defense.</i>

06:36.850 --> 06:40.480
<i>His instant decision-making ability is on a completely different level than before!</i>

06:40.560 --> 06:43.230
What's wrong, Bachira? Try to get past.

06:43.320 --> 06:45.940
<i>He's improved the way he uses his eyes.</i>

06:46.530 --> 06:47.690
<i>Then I'll take a risk</i>

06:48.280 --> 06:50.160
<i>and go in from this side!</i>

06:50.780 --> 06:51.910
<i>Just as I predicted.</i>

06:52.530 --> 06:54.490
I'll take him, bangs.

06:55.160 --> 06:56.290
<i>Barou?</i>

06:56.370 --> 06:59.710
<i>Did he predict my move and come with Isagi to pressure me?</i>

06:59.790 --> 07:02.330
Bachira, fall back for now!

07:02.420 --> 07:03.540
<i>There's nothing I can do.</i>

07:09.430 --> 07:10.930
- Thanks.
- Isagi?

07:11.010 --> 07:12.260
Get off, damn it!

07:13.220 --> 07:15.470
<i>What are they doing?</i>

07:15.560 --> 07:18.480
<i>Aren't they positioned in a planned way?</i>

07:18.560 --> 07:20.810
<i>They're taking advantage of each other,</i>

07:20.890 --> 07:23.410
<i>devouring each other to get the ball.</i>

07:23.860 --> 07:26.820
<i>A bond of devouring. An opposing union!</i>

07:26.900 --> 07:29.240
How am I supposed to understand that at a glance?

07:31.030 --> 07:31.950
Make it soft.

07:32.030 --> 07:33.700
I know. Here, right?

07:34.240 --> 07:36.030
<i>A lob. Nice pass.</i>

07:36.620 --> 07:37.700
<i>I see.</i>

07:37.790 --> 07:42.080
<i>So he's on guard against my control and isn't coming.</i>

07:42.170 --> 07:45.920
<i>I can't play as I want while he keeps his distance.</i>

07:46.000 --> 07:49.380
<i>Even if I try to pass him without slowing down,</i>

07:49.470 --> 07:52.220
<i>he's not at a distance I can pass with a single move.</i>

07:52.300 --> 07:56.310
<i>But if I stop the ball, he'll be in front of me in one step.</i>

07:56.390 --> 07:58.390
<i>In a perfect position.</i>

07:59.020 --> 08:00.430
<i>Was watching my play</i>

08:00.520 --> 08:03.850
<i>just once enough for you, Itoshi Rin?</i>

08:03.940 --> 08:05.730
<i>This is what they call a genius.</i>

08:05.810 --> 08:08.440
<i>So, what should I do now?</i>

08:09.900 --> 08:12.400
<i>Can you feel it? This is the only point.</i>

08:12.490 --> 08:13.700
Red panther.

08:13.780 --> 08:15.660
Doesn't matter! I'll break through.

08:15.740 --> 08:17.870
What a glamorous pass.

08:17.950 --> 08:21.620
<i>Aryu and Rin's distance versus my max speed.</i>

08:21.710 --> 08:25.460
<i>The moment all of these intersect,</i>

08:25.540 --> 08:29.380
<i>that point is the only chance I can get past!</i>

08:31.170 --> 08:34.050
What happened to these guys?

08:34.720 --> 08:38.140
<i>They stole the ball with Isagi and Barou's opposing play.</i>

08:38.720 --> 08:40.140
<i>And as soon as they took it,</i>

08:40.220 --> 08:43.480
<i>Isagi and Nagi instantly saw the same thing.</i>

08:43.560 --> 08:48.190
<i>On top of that, Nagi's pass to the critical point.</i>

08:48.270 --> 08:51.860
<i>As a result, the ball reached Chigiri's legs.</i>

08:51.940 --> 08:55.530
<i>This is the chemical reaction they developed to beat us.</i>

08:55.610 --> 08:56.490
ISAGI YOICHI X BAROU SHOUEI

08:56.570 --> 08:57.820
<i>Perfect teamwork!</i>

08:58.870 --> 09:01.450
<i>Worthy opponents to defeat.</i>

09:04.250 --> 09:05.370
That's it!

09:05.460 --> 09:06.420
Nicely done, princess.

09:06.500 --> 09:07.330
That's it!

09:08.840 --> 09:11.130
I've been waiting for you, egoist.

09:13.090 --> 09:14.970
The monster is thrilled.

09:18.800 --> 09:21.640
<i>35 meters to the goal.</i>

09:21.720 --> 09:25.190
<i>Not even Rin can shoot directly from this distance.</i>

09:25.270 --> 09:26.270
<i>But still...</i>

09:26.350 --> 09:29.520
Have they gotten stronger compared to before?

09:29.610 --> 09:32.110
The blood flowing through my veins cries out for glamour.

09:32.690 --> 09:36.070
<i>There's no way the top three will lose like this!</i>

09:36.660 --> 09:40.080
<i>We'll keep attacking and give them no breathing room.</i>

09:40.160 --> 09:41.160
<i>We</i>

09:42.240 --> 09:44.160
<i>are warriors!</i>

09:44.250 --> 09:45.830
Let's play, Isagi.

09:45.910 --> 09:47.580
I won't give it up so easily this time.

09:48.250 --> 09:51.590
<i>He keeps dribbling while watching out for Barou.</i>

09:51.670 --> 09:55.090
<i>It's impossible to steal the ball while Bachira is moving.</i>

09:56.130 --> 09:58.510
<i>From the wing? Aryu?</i>

09:58.590 --> 10:00.300
<i>No, it's fine.</i>

10:00.390 --> 10:03.970
<i>Nagi is on defense. Chigiri is marking his man.</i>

10:04.060 --> 10:06.230
<i>The worst case is him getting past me.</i>

10:06.310 --> 10:08.060
<i>We'll handle everything else.</i>

10:08.150 --> 10:09.310
Hey, bangs!

10:10.400 --> 10:11.650
<i>He stopped dribbling?</i>

10:11.730 --> 10:14.320
<i>Nice, Barou. I can take it now.</i>

10:15.110 --> 10:16.450
<i>He passed without looking?</i>

10:17.700 --> 10:19.030
To you, Aryu-kun!

10:19.110 --> 10:19.950
Run!

10:20.030 --> 10:21.070
Get the ball, princess!

10:23.200 --> 10:25.330
This much is against the law.

10:25.410 --> 10:28.920
Don't be ridiculous. This is my domain.

10:29.000 --> 10:31.630
And with your speed, before you can even catch up,

10:31.710 --> 10:32.790
I'll clear the ball!

10:32.880 --> 10:35.260
It's coming! My ball!

10:35.340 --> 10:37.880
Screw you, you muscle mass!

10:38.840 --> 10:40.510
Scary gorilla guy!

10:40.590 --> 10:41.890
Who did you call a gorilla?

10:43.600 --> 10:44.560
<i>I can't</i>

10:44.640 --> 10:46.640
<i>budge this guy.</i>

10:46.730 --> 10:48.140
No way!

10:48.230 --> 10:49.730
<i>Are you kidding me?</i>

10:49.810 --> 10:50.940
Take this!

10:51.020 --> 10:52.940
<i>A one-touch pass? But to whom?</i>

10:54.440 --> 10:55.610
<i>Shit!</i>

10:55.690 --> 10:58.650
<i>This range is Rin's zone!</i>

10:59.530 --> 11:00.740
No, I'm right here.

11:01.240 --> 11:03.160
- I won't let him shoot.
- Nagi!

11:04.120 --> 11:05.830
Is he going to shoot without hesitating?

11:05.910 --> 11:07.910
<i>Nagi is predicting all his moves</i>

11:08.000 --> 11:09.920
<i>and barely giving him a shooting opportunity.</i>

11:10.000 --> 11:12.040
<i>No. That actually works in his favor.</i>

11:13.090 --> 11:14.210
<i>A fake shot!</i>

11:14.960 --> 11:17.090
<i>He used Nagi as bait and slipped away.</i>

11:17.170 --> 11:18.880
<i>Rin is one step ahead.</i>

11:19.550 --> 11:21.090
<i>But in the time he lost,</i>

11:21.800 --> 11:23.050
<i>I can catch up!</i>

11:23.140 --> 11:24.300
Nice block, Isagi!

11:24.390 --> 11:25.560
Let's pressure him two-on-one!

11:25.640 --> 11:26.770
Great, Chigiri!

11:26.850 --> 11:28.310
<i>So it's two-on-one now.</i>

11:30.100 --> 11:31.230
<i>Bachira?</i>

11:31.310 --> 11:32.730
<i>No way! Two-on-two!</i>

11:32.810 --> 11:34.770
<i>Is he going to pass? Dribble?</i>

11:35.770 --> 11:38.940
He's going to shoot between the two of us? Greedy bastard!

11:39.530 --> 11:40.450
No.

11:41.070 --> 11:42.160
<i>This is a fake too!</i>

11:42.950 --> 11:47.450
<i>He didn't give me a chance to think after it became two-on-two.</i>

11:48.700 --> 11:49.750
<i>The situation is bad.</i>

11:49.830 --> 11:53.130
<i>Everyone on the field is moving according to Rin's flawless plan!</i>

11:54.080 --> 11:57.210
<i>Shooting, dribbling, spatial awareness,</i>

11:57.300 --> 11:58.340
<i>strategy…</i>

11:58.920 --> 12:03.640
<i>Even without a chemical reaction, Rin alone</i>

12:03.720 --> 12:06.180
<i>is a monster who can create countless attacks!</i>

12:07.430 --> 12:09.020
<i>He really is on a different level!</i>

12:09.100 --> 12:10.060
Screw this!

12:10.930 --> 12:15.730
At least you've learned how to use your eyes on the field.

12:17.440 --> 12:19.190
But this kind of weak soccer,

12:20.690 --> 12:23.110
it doesn't excite me.

12:28.620 --> 12:32.290
Seriously? How are we supposed to stop something like that?

12:33.540 --> 12:34.620
<i>No.</i>

12:34.710 --> 12:37.500
<i>We didn't stop it, but we got close.</i>

12:38.300 --> 12:39.960
<i>In the previous match,</i>

12:39.960 --> 12:42.170
<i>we didn't even understand how we lost.</i>

12:42.300 --> 12:43.930
<i>But right now,</i>

12:44.010 --> 12:46.840
<i>I understand everything behind Rin's movements.</i>

12:48.470 --> 12:50.890
<i>If I can devour him, I'll win!</i>

13:02.030 --> 13:03.360
<i>Think.</i>

13:03.450 --> 13:07.030
<i>How can I neutralize Rin and control the field?</i>

13:07.950 --> 13:10.330
Nice goal!

13:10.410 --> 13:14.000
I give that volley shot of yours 1 glamour point.

13:14.080 --> 13:17.960
Seriously? Is Rin really this amazing?

13:18.040 --> 13:21.300
Sorry, I couldn't even get close to stopping him.

13:21.380 --> 13:24.050
But how can he play like that?

13:24.130 --> 13:26.430
Is he just on a completely different dimension from us?

13:27.050 --> 13:30.060
No, let me explain how he got past you.

13:30.140 --> 13:31.060
In that play just now,

13:32.310 --> 13:36.690
<i>Rin positioned himself to receive the ball in his own range.</i>

13:36.770 --> 13:37.810
<i>Because of that, we</i>

13:37.900 --> 13:41.820
<i>were forced to just react to him.</i>

13:42.400 --> 13:45.320
He foresees a few steps ahead on the field

13:45.400 --> 13:48.070
and makes us do what he wants without letting us think.

13:49.030 --> 13:52.120
This is probably Rin's classic play style.

13:52.700 --> 13:56.040
I wonder if I can keep up with him?

13:56.120 --> 13:58.790
By the way, Isagi,

13:59.500 --> 14:02.250
the fact that you could explain Rin's play just like that

14:02.340 --> 14:04.300
is also pretty amazing.

14:05.760 --> 14:07.010
<i>I see.</i>

14:07.930 --> 14:12.180
<i>I'm the only one on the field who can see Rin's play.</i>

14:13.010 --> 14:15.890
<i>In that case, the only thing that can stop Rin</i>

14:15.980 --> 14:17.980
<i>is my eyes and my brain!</i>

14:20.190 --> 14:22.360
The score is still 1-1! Let's go!

14:22.940 --> 14:24.610
Right. Our attacks are working.

14:24.690 --> 14:25.940
Counterattack,

14:26.440 --> 14:27.780
starts.

14:27.860 --> 14:28.910
Got it.

14:31.160 --> 14:34.660
<i>Against Aryu, who has a high reach, will he pass or get past?</i>

14:34.740 --> 14:35.580
<i>But</i>

14:35.660 --> 14:40.380
<i>Rin is positioned to counter both situations.</i>

14:40.460 --> 14:43.340
<i>But if he does that, Nagi will be free.</i>

14:43.420 --> 14:46.380
<i>Bachira can't hold both of us!</i>

14:47.590 --> 14:50.720
<i>When everyone is focused on Nagi,</i>

14:50.800 --> 14:53.470
<i>I'll sneak behind from the blind spot!</i>

14:53.560 --> 14:55.220
<i>See me, Chigiri! Pass to me!</i>

14:57.480 --> 14:58.890
<i>Great. And so—</i>

15:00.690 --> 15:02.560
<i>No freaking way.</i>

15:02.650 --> 15:05.780
<i>He completely predicted my off-the-ball play!</i>

15:06.530 --> 15:07.440
<i>Shit!</i>

15:08.030 --> 15:10.410
<i>So he even calculated my movements?</i>

15:10.490 --> 15:13.660
<i>Our field vision should have been the same! But</i>

15:14.370 --> 15:18.790
<i>Rin is one step ahead of me!</i>

15:19.790 --> 15:21.000
You can't get past.

15:21.080 --> 15:22.750
You stand out too much, brat.

15:23.500 --> 15:26.500
Oh, really? Are you passing, Rin-chan?

15:26.590 --> 15:29.010
Carry the ball all the way to the goal.

15:29.090 --> 15:30.720
As you command, boss!

15:30.800 --> 15:32.470
Get back! Counter!

15:33.180 --> 15:34.100
Shit!

15:34.180 --> 15:36.140
<i>You're amazing, Isagi.</i>

15:36.220 --> 15:39.390
<i>You've reached a level where you can challenge Rin.</i>

15:40.560 --> 15:43.150
<i>This is unfair. Let me join in too.</i>

15:43.810 --> 15:45.190
<i>I'm going to inject</i>

15:47.900 --> 15:49.990
<i>my ideas into the field!</i>

15:50.070 --> 15:51.990
<i>A shot? No,</i>

15:52.820 --> 15:54.660
<i>a vertical curve?</i>

15:54.740 --> 15:57.990
<i>A suddenly lofted, very long pass?</i>

15:58.080 --> 16:02.460
<i>But the ball isn't for Rin. Bachira's target is</i>

16:03.460 --> 16:04.670
<i>Aryu!</i>

16:04.750 --> 16:08.630
A glamorous curve like a work of art.

16:08.710 --> 16:12.090
<i>But Chigiri can reach it with his speed!</i>

16:12.180 --> 16:14.180
I'll show you, glamorous ball.

16:14.800 --> 16:17.060
By the way, I'm here too.

16:17.140 --> 16:19.020
<i>Nagi also fell back in front of the goal.</i>

16:19.100 --> 16:20.060
<i>Good.</i>

16:20.640 --> 16:22.520
<i>Nagi can intervene in the aerial ball,</i>

16:22.600 --> 16:25.900
<i>and Chigiri can reach the ground ball before Aryu!</i>

16:25.980 --> 16:27.860
<i>He can't reach this pass!</i>

16:27.940 --> 16:29.730
Wake up, Mr. Glamour.

16:29.820 --> 16:31.190
That pass,

16:31.280 --> 16:34.200
look at its arrival, not where it will land.

16:35.320 --> 16:36.160
<i>I see.</i>

16:36.740 --> 16:41.960
<i>If I wait for the ball to come down, I'll lose it.</i>

16:42.040 --> 16:46.790
<i>So I have to catch the ball in the air.</i>

16:46.880 --> 16:49.340
<i>A point in the sky</i>

16:50.170 --> 16:52.050
<i>that only I can reach!</i>

16:52.130 --> 16:53.350
He jumped already?

16:53.350 --> 16:54.250
Is this for real?

16:54.630 --> 16:56.550
Let the dance begin.

16:56.640 --> 16:57.640
<i>Shit!</i>

16:57.720 --> 17:00.100
<i>Aryu and Bachira's chemical reaction!</i>

17:00.180 --> 17:02.560
<i>The top three, who played individually,</i>

17:02.640 --> 17:04.480
<i>have started to build team play!</i>

17:08.310 --> 17:11.190
<i>I thought we would win if we stopped Rin.</i>

17:11.280 --> 17:14.450
<i>Bachira's ideas accelerated the evolution of the game.</i>

17:17.990 --> 17:20.120
I'm grateful, Bachira Meguru.

17:20.950 --> 17:26.210
Your pass allowed me to set sail towards new glamours.

17:26.290 --> 17:27.170
You're welcome.

17:28.380 --> 17:31.250
<i>This is the final showdown!</i>

17:31.340 --> 17:32.800
<i>What a match!</i>

17:34.090 --> 17:36.090
<i>A fierce match.</i>

17:36.800 --> 17:41.430
<i>Isagi and Rin are fighting for control of the field.</i>

17:42.020 --> 17:45.440
<i>Moreover, while we're barely managing against Rin,</i>

17:46.100 --> 17:47.850
<i>his ideas</i>

17:47.940 --> 17:50.690
<i>are forcing the top three into a chemical reaction!</i>

17:52.110 --> 17:52.940
Weak.

17:53.030 --> 17:54.530
The bleeding stopped.

17:55.450 --> 17:56.530
We took the lead.

17:56.610 --> 18:01.030
<i>Now they're more than just a team with individual skills.</i>

18:01.910 --> 18:04.000
<i>These guys are seriously strong.</i>

18:08.500 --> 18:10.210
<i>I want to crush them!</i>

18:12.300 --> 18:14.710
<i>The reason I can experience these feelings</i>

18:15.550 --> 18:19.260
<i>is because Reo invited me that day.</i>

18:21.100 --> 18:22.220
<i>Look, Reo.</i>

18:22.310 --> 18:25.890
<i>Maybe you're right.</i>

18:28.020 --> 18:34.860
<i>I came to Blue Lock, learned about soccer and defeat, and changed.</i>

18:35.440 --> 18:38.070
<i>But I want to become even stronger.</i>

18:40.070 --> 18:41.120
<i>I'm sorry, Reo.</i>

18:42.740 --> 18:44.410
<i>The me who parted ways with you,</i>

18:44.490 --> 18:45.830
Nagi, let's crush them all.

18:45.910 --> 18:48.120
<i>The me who abandoned you and changed,</i>

18:48.710 --> 18:50.580
Let's devour them all.

18:50.670 --> 18:53.090
<i>The me who is fighting alongside Isagi,</i>

18:54.050 --> 18:54.920
Okay.

18:56.210 --> 18:58.590
<i>please forgive, for now.</i>

19:00.220 --> 19:02.300
I'm coming. No matter how many times.

19:02.300 --> 19:04.310
I'll stop you. No matter how many times.

19:04.310 --> 19:05.270
Hey, Chigiri!

19:05.350 --> 19:07.390
- Pass to me!
- No, you can't do that!

19:07.480 --> 19:08.980
Get lost!

19:11.600 --> 19:15.070
<i>Isagi is constantly watching for a pass from Chigiri.</i>

19:15.650 --> 19:18.780
<i>Using Barou, who is circling around Chigiri, as a decoy,</i>

19:18.860 --> 19:22.070
<i>he's looking for a direct shot position that Rin can't reach.</i>

19:22.700 --> 19:24.330
<i>But Rin is aware of this.</i>

19:25.450 --> 19:29.660
<i>Even though I can't fully understand what they see,</i>

19:29.750 --> 19:34.130
<i>their vision is probably at the same level.</i>

19:34.210 --> 19:36.340
<i>Despite that, the reason Isagi loses</i>

19:36.880 --> 19:38.840
<i>is physical ability.</i>

19:39.380 --> 19:42.760
<i>That's why Isagi can't take that final step.</i>

19:42.840 --> 19:44.470
<i>In that case, I</i>

19:44.550 --> 19:46.470
<i>will become the final piece!</i>

19:47.520 --> 19:49.140
<i>Isagi. Rin.</i>

19:49.230 --> 19:52.440
<i>The scenario you've written for the field,</i>

19:53.310 --> 19:55.020
<i>I'll tear it apart!</i>

19:57.570 --> 19:59.780
<i>Respond if you can.</i>

19:59.860 --> 20:03.450
<i>Don't think I'm someone who will play according to your predictions!</i>

20:03.530 --> 20:04.910
Nagi!

20:06.450 --> 20:09.330
<i>He reacted fast. This is his range.</i>

20:09.950 --> 20:11.370
<i>Then I'll leave it to you.</i>

20:11.460 --> 20:14.250
<i>Come on, Isagi. Keep up with the flow of the field!</i>

20:14.330 --> 20:16.250
<i>For my goal,</i>

20:19.010 --> 20:21.630
<i>reshape the future of the field!</i>

20:24.390 --> 20:25.930
<i>Straight to Rin's back.</i>

20:26.010 --> 20:27.260
Perfect.

20:27.970 --> 20:29.220
<i>This again?</i>

20:29.810 --> 20:33.310
<i>Despite that perfect pass, he barely predicted and reacted to it.</i>

20:33.980 --> 20:34.980
<i>Then I'll just</i>

20:35.690 --> 20:36.860
<i>shoot now!</i>

20:37.940 --> 20:41.400
<i>After pretending to do that and controlling it first.</i>

20:43.400 --> 20:44.990
<i>A two-stage fake volley!</i>

20:49.990 --> 20:51.290
Are you a god or something?

20:53.080 --> 20:57.750
<i>Seriously, as long as I'm with Isagi, I can keep getting stronger forever.</i>

20:59.050 --> 21:00.170
<i>I'm sorry, Reo.</i>

21:00.670 --> 21:04.880
<i>After taking this poison, I can't go back anymore.</i>

21:05.970 --> 21:07.930
What the hell was that?

21:08.010 --> 21:09.680
It was a magnificent glamour.

21:11.140 --> 21:12.930
You lost, Rin-chan.

21:13.770 --> 21:15.350
Are you still weak?

21:18.650 --> 21:21.070
Shut up, bangs.

21:23.150 --> 21:26.160
I'm getting fired up from anger too.

22:58.540 --> 23:01.960
<i>Blue Lock, Extra Time.</i>

23:02.040 --> 23:04.800
Therefore...

23:04.880 --> 23:06.960
Listen, this part is important,

23:07.050 --> 23:08.970
listen carefully.

23:09.050 --> 23:10.220
1ST LESSON

23:11.300 --> 23:13.220
2nd Lesson

23:13.300 --> 23:14.970
3rd Lesson

23:15.970 --> 23:17.480
<i>Did you go into hibernation?</i>

23:17.560 --> 23:18.770
<i>Is he dead, I wonder?</i>

23:19.770 --> 23:21.480
Minovsky particles!

23:21.560 --> 23:22.440
The lesson is history!

23:22.520 --> 23:26.030
Screw the particles! You're going to fail the lesson!

23:26.940 --> 23:28.150
HISTORY LESSON RESULTS

23:28.240 --> 23:29.530
You're amazing, Reo.

23:29.610 --> 23:31.160
You got first place.

23:31.240 --> 23:33.410
No, it's amazing that you got second place.